{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06620","headline":"贻鼓吹李丞时信安王北伐李公王之所器者也 · 储光羲","name":"贻鼓吹李丞时信安王北伐李公王之所器者也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北伐昧天造，王师示有征。\n辕门统元律，帝室命宗英。\n灵威方首事，仗钺按边城。\n膏雨被春草，黄云浮太清。\n文儒托後乘，武旅趋前旌。\n出车发西洛，营军临北平。\n曰予深固陋，志气颇纵横。\n尝思骠骑幕，愿逐嫖姚兵。\n惟贤美无度，海内依扬声。\n河间旧相许，车骑日逢迎。\n折节下谋士，深心论客卿。\n忠言虽未列，庶以知君诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}